{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903830/extras/9af5c4fd34890b77ca52759b88dd20f4.avif?t=1774302224\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minori, a skilled mage and priestess, takes on the dangerous mission of defeating the Evil Eye to prove her strength. After infiltrating his castle, she falls victim to a powerful trap and loses her magic. Just as hope seems lost, she\u2019s rescued by a mysterious healer who helps her recover and regain her abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, Minori must fight her way through enemy-filled stages, each offering new challenges. Her ultimate goal: reach the heart of the castle and defeat the Evil Eye once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903830/extras/6b9914ccdd0ce943e69a032f2a01bacc.avif?t=1774302224\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena of Sacrifice is a fun 2D beat 'em up side scroller with a solid and fast paced combat system. Power through different stages, fighting off enemies with your branching power moves, while avoiding to get hit yourself. The more you progress, the more combat moves you unlock, while at the same time the enemies get harder too! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903830/extras/936a419adfe19befc5a42744c824b730.avif?t=1774302224\" width=616 height=608 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903830/extras/e77d42c0d91736ffdebef7028fd6a1bd.avif?t=1774302224\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast paced combat and branching combo moves</strong> to get through the enemy's onslaught.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new skills</strong> as Minori recovers her magic, expanding your options with each stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of enemies</strong>, each with a unique design and fighting style. Learn all their moves and predict their strikes ahead of time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple dungeon levels and challenging boss fights</strong> that become progressively tougher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art graphics</strong> that give the game a nostalgic, retro feel.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903830?t=1774302224","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903830/df80a28327c7d1184f99fd10c05e4eb0f283ff94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774302224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903830/94ad8d192081a5e76835ec1b53c0ccbabc41302c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774302224","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903830/94ad8d192081a5e76835ec1b53c0ccbabc41302c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774302224","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903830/extras/9af5c4fd34890b77ca52759b88dd20f4.avif?t=1774302224\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minori, a skilled mage and priestess, takes on the dangerous mission of defeating the Evil Eye to prove her strength. After infiltrating his castle, she falls victim to a powerful trap and loses her magic. Just as hope seems lost, she\u2019s rescued by a mysterious healer who helps her recover and regain her abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, Minori must fight her way through enemy-filled stages, each offering new challenges. Her ultimate goal: reach the heart of the castle and defeat the Evil Eye once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903830/extras/6b9914ccdd0ce943e69a032f2a01bacc.avif?t=1774302224\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena of Sacrifice is a fun 2D beat 'em up side scroller with a solid and fast paced combat system. Power through different stages, fighting off enemies with your branching power moves, while avoiding to get hit yourself. The more you progress, the more combat moves you unlock, while at the same time the enemies get harder too! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903830/extras/936a419adfe19befc5a42744c824b730.avif?t=1774302224\" width=616 height=608 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903830/extras/e77d42c0d91736ffdebef7028fd6a1bd.avif?t=1774302224\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast paced combat and branching combo moves</strong> to get through the enemy's onslaught.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new skills</strong> as Minori recovers her magic, expanding your options with each stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of enemies</strong>, each with a unique design and fighting style. Learn all their moves and predict their strikes ahead of time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple dungeon levels and challenging boss fights</strong> that become progressively tougher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art graphics</strong> that give the game a nostalgic, retro feel.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Under Hill"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903830/0f0454dfb68865969c5a52991dc53944f27d43a0/header.jpg?t=1774302224","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3903830/459580962/1a556cb080c4e12c26e3b469bb202727804e8570/1761877924/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761878720","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3903830/459580962/1a556cb080c4e12c26e3b469bb202727804e8570/1761877924/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761878720","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3903830/459580962/1a556cb080c4e12c26e3b469bb202727804e8570/1761877924/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761878720","id":257224854,"name":"English","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257224854/27bf1ced464ec2f901739b91a73c86dcc95ff69f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761878720"}],"name":"Arena of Sacrifice","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows\u00ae 7/8/8.1/10<br></li><li><strong>Pr